- ak-markdown-novel-viewer: View markdown in a calm, book-like reader served over HTTP. - Invoke to read long RFCs, runbooks, specs or novels distraction-free.
- ak-mcp-builder: Build, upgrade, test and publish MCP servers (spec 2026-07-28, TypeScript SDK v2, Python mcp v2 MCPServer), OAuth, evals, MCP Registry. - Invoke for MCP server or tool design; not for configuring clients or calling existing servers.
- ak-media-processing: Process media with FFmpeg (video/audio), ImageMagick (images) and RMBG (AI background removal). - Invoke for encoding, conversion, thumbnails or HLS/DASH streaming.
- ak-mermaidjs-v11: Create Mermaid.js v11 flowcharts and sequence, class, ER, Gantt, state, architecture, timeline or user-journey diagrams. - Invoke when diagrams belong inline in Markdown.
