- ak-orchestrate: Run staged or parallel jobs as resumable sessions of this runtime, or opted-in live-verified runtimes and Pi, with worktrees, fallback, safety gates, a final arbiter. - Invoke to route split work by capability, risk and quota, or to onboard Pi.
- ak-page-builder: Build, extend or operate an agent-operated page builder from project components: resizable widgets, touch editors, previews, publishing. - Invoke when no operator skill exists yet; not for one-off page design or a generic API wrapper.
- ak-payment-integration: Integrate SePay and PayFS (Vietnamese bank transfers, VietQR), Polar, Stripe, Creem, Dodo Payments, Lemon Squeezy, Paddle or PayPal. - Invoke for checkout, webhooks, subscriptions, usage billing or license keys.
