- ak-predict: Have 5 expert personas debate a change to catch architecture, security, performance and UX issues early. - Invoke before major features or risky changes.
- ak-preview: View files or generate visual explanations, slides and diagrams such as code walkthroughs or HTML/Markdown presentations. - Invoke for file previews or architecture visualization.
- ak-problem-solving: Apply systematic techniques when stuck: complexity spirals, innovation blocks, recurring patterns, assumptions, simplification or scale. - Invoke for structured reframing of a blocked problem.
- ak-project-management: Track progress and plan statuses, coordinate runtime work, report, and keep cross-session continuity. - Invoke when work spans sessions or needs a handoff.
