- ak-remotion: Build programmatic video with Remotion in React, including animated sequences and data-driven renders. - Invoke for React-based video generation.
- ak-repomix: Pack repositories into AI-friendly XML, Markdown or plain-text files with Repomix. - Invoke for onboarding, LLM context, security audits or library analysis.
- ak-research: Research technical solutions, analyze architectures and gather requirements. - Invoke before implementation to evaluate technology or best practices.
- ak-research-prompt: Draft a self-contained research brief for a human or AI researcher. - Use when asked for a research prompt to hand off, not the research.
- ak-retro: Generate data-driven sprint retrospectives from any solo or team git history. - Invoke for sprint or quarterly reviews, code health or team velocity.
- ak-review-pr: Review GitHub PRs for correctness, regressions and security; fix, reply and merge modes authorize those steps. - Invoke for PR numbers or URLs, to fix findings, post the review back to GitHub or merge when ready and watch CI.
- ak-scenario: Generate edge cases and test scenarios by decomposing a feature across 12 dimensions. - Invoke for risk discovery, QA planning or regression design.
- ak-scout: Scout a codebase fast with native search, optional Explore agents and user-permitted OpenCode probes. - Invoke for file discovery, task context or scoped searches.
