- ak-shopify: Build Shopify apps, extensions and themes with Shopify CLI, GraphQL/REST APIs, Polaris UI and Liquid. - Invoke for checkout customization, webhooks or billing integration.
- ak-show-off: Create preference-aware self-contained HTML pages that showcase work. - Invoke for demos, visual presentations or interactive showcases.
